## Reproducible stack and working principles

The principles are in `PRINCIPLES.md` and load automatically through
`.claude/rules/working-principles.md`. Commands:

- `make setup` — conda env, renv restore, CmdStan, git hooks (fresh machine)
- `make all` — full pipeline, then the site
- `make check` — pipe gate, Python and R tests, notes check
- `make pin` — regenerate `environment.yml` and `renv.lock` from what the code uses
- `make help` — everything else
